    {
      "id": "descText",
      "type": "lookup",
      "params": {
        "values": [
          "FOR THOSE NEW TO THE FIGHT. HOSTILES REACT SLOWLY AND YOUR SUIT RECHARGES FAST.",
          "BALANCED COMBAT. ENEMIES FLANK AND SUPPRESS, BUT A CAREFUL APPROACH CARRIES YOU THROUGH.",
          "HOSTILES COORDINATE AND PUNISH EXPOSURE. RECOMMENDED ONCE YOU KNOW THE JUNGLE.",
          "AIM ASSIST IS OFF AND SUIT ENERGY DRAINS FASTER. EVERY MISTAKE IS PAID FOR.",
          "ONE LIFE. NO MARKERS. CHECKPOINTS DISABLED. THE JUNGLE DOES NOT FORGIVE."
        ]
      }
    },
